## Setup app.html

{% filename name="src/app.html" %}

```html
<meta name="theme-color" content="#151515" />
<link rel="manifest" href="%sveltekit.assets%/manifest.json" />
```

{% /filename %}

## Setup manifest

{% filename name="static/manifest.json" %}

```json
{
    "theme_color": "#151515",
    "background_color": "#151515",
    "display": "standalone",
    "scope": "/",
    "start_url": "/",
    "name": "Fabian9799",
    "short_name": "Fabian",
    "icons": [
        {
            "src": "/icon-192.png",
            "sizes": "192x192",
            "type": "image/png"
        }
    ]
}
```

{% /filename %}

## Notes

- Replace #151515 with your preferred color
- Add icons to:
  - /static/icon-192.png
  - /static/icon.svg